## APIs / Endpoints (suggested)

* `POST /strategies` — create strategy
* `GET /strategies` — list strategies (global + user)
* `GET /strategies/{id}` — get strategy
* `POST /signals` — create signal from scanner result
* `GET /signals` — list signals with filters
* `GET /signals/{id}` — get signal
* `PATCH /signals/{id}` — edit signal (e.g., add exit criteria)
* `POST /signals/{id}/close` — close signal manually with reason

Payloads should follow the Data Model above.

