## Testing & Acceptance Criteria

* Unit tests for expression parsing and evaluation.
* Integration tests for scanner → save signal → monitor → close flow (including auto-reversal flows).
* UI tests for Save Signal modal and Signal list CRUD.
* Manual acceptance: create a sample RSI single-indicator strategy and prove that:

  * `entry-only` signals are saved and remain open until manual close
  * `entry+exit` signals close when exit expression becomes true
  * `auto-reversal-to-opposite` closes and creates opposite signals when reversal triggers

