## Example Use Cases

### 1) Single-indicator short with auto-exit & reversal

* Strategy: `RSI(14) > 70` (short)
* Exit: `RSI(14) < 50`
* Auto-reversal: `auto-reversal-to-opposite`
* Behavior: when RSI falls below 50, close short and create a long signal if configured.

### 2) Multi-indicator entry and composite exit

* Strategy entry: `RSI(14) > 70 AND SMA(close, 20) < SMA(close, 50)` (short)
* Exit: `(RSI(14) < 40) OR (SMA20 crosses_above SMA50)`
* Behavior: signal closes when either exit condition is met.

